---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updatedAt = '2026-04-18';
---

<BaseLayout title="Now — jwsung91" description="What I'm doing now.">
  <header class="mb-12">
    <a href="/" class="text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-300 text-sm transition-colors">← home</a>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mt-4 mb-1">/now</h1>
    <p class="text-zinc-600 text-xs">updated {updatedAt}</p>
  </header>

  <section class="space-y-10 text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Building</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-none">
        <li>
          <span class="text-zinc-100">unilink</span> —
          C++ 멀티플랫폼 통신 추상화 라이브러리. TCP/UDP/시리얼을 단일 인터페이스로.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Reading</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-500 italic">—</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Thinking about</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-500 italic">—</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
